msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "HivelyTracker Audio Decoder"
msgstr "HivelyTracker audio dekoder"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Hively Tracker is a tracker program based upon the AHX format created in the mid '90s by Dexter and Pink of Abyss. The format was relatively popular, and many songs were created and used in scene productions and games. AHX was designed to create a very SID-like sound on the Amiga."
msgstr "Hively Tracker je program za praćenje zasnovan na AHX formatu koji su sredinom 90-ih kreirali Dexter i Pink iz Abyssa. Format je bio relativno popularan i mnoge pjesme su kreirane i korištene u scenskim produkcijama i igrama. AHX je dizajniran da stvori zvuk vrlo sličan SID-u na Amigi."
